From: AliGram <aligram@local>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:39:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 29/67] =?UTF-8?q?fix(aligram):=20O-03=20=E2=80=94=20StatFs?=
 =?UTF-8?q?-failure=20log=20says=20the=20copy=20proceeds=20unguarded?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The old line ('StatFs failed, continuing without headroom check') did not
state that the copy proceeds with NO headroom check at all. The log now
says UNGUARDED explicitly, names the blob dir and source file and the
failure cause, and notes the mid-copy ENOSPC handling is the only
remaining guard. Fail-safe behaviour unchanged: the copy still proceeds.
---
 .../java/com/radolyn/ayugram/aligram/AliGramFileCopy.java  | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/com/radolyn/ayugram/aligram/AliGramFileCopy.java b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/com/radolyn/ayugram/aligram/AliGramFileCopy.java
index 490d498b8..473658232 100644
--- a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/com/radolyn/ayugram/aligram/AliGramFileCopy.java
+++ b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/com/radolyn/ayugram/aligram/AliGramFileCopy.java
@@ -112,7 +112,12 @@ public final class AliGramFileCopy {
                 return new CopyResult(false, null, null, null, 0, AliGramEligibility.REASON_NO_SPACE);
             }
         } catch (Throwable e) {
-            FileLog.e("AliGram: StatFs failed, continuing without headroom check", e);
+            // O-03 (Phase 3.2): the fail-safe itself is unchanged — the copy
+            // still proceeds — but the log must say so explicitly: there is
+            // now NO headroom check, and the mid-copy ENOSPC handling is
+            // the only remaining guard. Context (blob dir, source file,
+            // failure cause) is included so the line is actionable.
+            FileLog.e("AliGram: StatFs failed for blob dir " + dir.getAbsolutePath() + " while copying " + source.getAbsolutePath() + " (" + e + ") — continuing UNGUARDED with no headroom check; the mid-copy ENOSPC handling is the only remaining guard", e);
         }
 
         File tempFile = new File(dir, finalFileName + ".tmp-" + refId);
